      "name": "original_low_energy_exponential",
      "qualifiedName": "Shao.OQ6.OriginalLowEnergyTail.original_low_energy_exponential",
      "head": "theorem original_low_energy_exponential\n    {Ω : Type*} [mΩ : MeasurableSpace Ω]\n    (μ : Measure Ω) [hμ : IsProbabilityMeasure μ]\n    (g : Ω → ℝ) (hg : Measurable g) (hg2 : MemLp g 2 μ)\n    (hgsecond : (∫ o : Ω, (g o) ^ (2 : ℕ) ∂μ) = 1) :\n    ∃ c : ℝ, 0 < c ∧ ∀ n : ℕ,\n      (Shao.OQ6.CanonicalDoubleGhostRowMoments.sampleLaw n μ).real\n        {x : Fin n → Ω |\n          Shao.OQ6.OriginalGhostGoodEvent.sampleEnergy n g x < (n : ℝ) / (2 : ℝ)} ≤\n        Real.exp (-c * (n : ℝ))",
      "headSHA256": "09361ab66494ab696223eab3331149c34d5ad11ee2b713dab8d66892b34aba88",
